but the API returns it as int. (limit is guarded with .toString(); offset is not.)
item_model.dart:32  -> _offset = json['offset'];
pending_item_model.dart:12 -> offset = json['offset'];
Both files IDENTICAL to base branch feat/human-review -> pre-existing, NOT introduced by NEARS-790.
Effect: vendor All Items + Pending Item lists render blank (wrapper parse throws before items iterate).
